      "type": "Formula re: Contains",
      "notes": "Iron bis-glycinate is a  well-studied, 100% fully-reacted, patented form of iron exclusively from Albion(R) Laboratories. The amino acid glycine is actually one of the two starting materials they body uses to synthesize hemoglobin. Therefore, Iron Glycinate contributes two key factors. This form of iron has higher bioavailability, lower toxicity, less food reactivity, less food interactions and has a longer shelf life than any other common form of iron."
